          "chunk_type": "scenario_summary",
          "content": "Scenario 3.3.2 Kịch bản thực thi PowerShell nghi vấn. Description: Reviewable MSHTA-PowerShell scenario in which cmd.exe launches mshta.exe and mshta.exe launches powershell.exe with -noexit -command Get-Service sysmon. Process creation records establish the launch command, not successful cmdlet completion or a finalized attack determination. Analysis status: draft_reviewable. Observed behavior: PowerShell was launched with -noexit -command Get-Service sysmon. cmd.exe launched mshta.exe with an inline vbscript:Execute command. mshta.exe launched PowerShell.",
          "entity_ids": [
            "process-7c96a17eb66f2831da61",
